   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.\n\nJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!\n\nThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. ",
